  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "ANN01",
      "text": "Welcome back to the Kumite World Tournament!",
      "chapter": 1,
      "masterStart": 4.2,
      "masterEnd": 6.96,
      "chapterLocalStart": 4.2,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 6.96,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "99aafd571c5e421ab37de568e50acbb795d103a479782c546adfa4097d29e625"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN02",
      "text": "Let\u2019s get ready for some blood!",
      "chapter": 1,
      "masterStart": 7.44,
      "masterEnd": 9.46,
      "chapterLocalStart": 7.44,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 9.46,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "116134df08caaec72fac38da3bd96667680c156f5bc11519e36280004210dfed"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN03",
      "text": "Starting off the Kumite, we have our first contenders. The one who talks but never says anything\u2026",
      "chapter": 2,
      "masterStart": 68.57,
      "masterEnd": 74.75,
      "chapterLocalStart": 0.03666666666666667,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 6.216666666666667,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "cd187a4555d10ad1b1e2466537285b9590116b4250524efbb5bd8c61b770d056"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN04",
      "text": "The handsome P. Tang! Versus a last-minute walk-in\u2026 Dragonfly Jones!",
      "chapter": 2,
      "masterStart": 76.32,
      "masterEnd": 82.1,
      "chapterLocalStart": 7.786666666666667,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 13.566666666666666,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "b8d73ef565d2082483c1ae52908408348409da72bef8885087abbb09bad2afe0"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN05",
      "text": "Now, our next two fighters! The Last Dragon, a student of Master Lee\u2014Bruce Leroy!",
      "chapter": 3,
      "masterStart": 174.78,
      "masterEnd": 181.1,
      "chapterLocalStart": 3.8133333333333335,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 10.133333333333333,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "dd454ccf1dc903ffbb7bc4f6001668d1409bf7a32daf155ec1799c7cc25d6993"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN06",
      "text": "Versus the one who came before even his master. The lord of the split\u2026 Franklin Duke!",
      "chapter": 3,
      "masterStart": 186.57,
      "masterEnd": 192.24,
      "chapterLocalStart": 15.603333333333333,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 21.273333333333333,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "4b9fca074452b7ff1b523ba17cbc3fc8a3e92b4c91f4ce3392580ab981277a7b"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN07",
      "text": "Our next two fighters! The flyest of the fly. He don\u2019t take no jive. He fights the man and gives oppression these hands\u2014Undercova Brotha! Versus the hands for hire, the knock-\u2019em-out knuckler, the Fadefather\u2014Bushedo Brown!",
      "chapter": 4,
      "masterStart": 282.84,
      "masterEnd": 297.74,
      "chapterLocalStart": 2.74,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 17.64,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "4ef1f1f6f500b0c20f1b48deaf0ecdbcdc5de8726d27e41844c5102d6c1cda4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN08",
      "text": "Our next two fighters\u2014Chonk Lee!",
      "chapter": 5,
      "masterStart": 380.5,
      "masterEnd": 383.0,
      "chapterLocalStart": 0.06666666666666667,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 2.566666666666667,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "b78469d2daec0d9b27ecca2e3e46bc4a78cf9b6a2023abc9d83f0c07898c8f5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN09",
      "text": "And Sho\u2019Nuff\u2014the hardest hitter out of Harlem!",
      "chapter": 5,
      "masterStart": 390.78,
      "masterEnd": 393.82,
      "chapterLocalStart": 10.346666666666666,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 13.386666666666667,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "cbbf0f4fde57b2a10967791b309561158c6effb6eef84b3b375fc4bfe854035b"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN10",
      "text": "Our next two fighters! The Y.N. with the Glo. Captain Save-a-Hoe himself\u2014Bruce Leroy!",
      "chapter": 5,
      "masterStart": 514.42,
      "masterEnd": 520.65,
      "chapterLocalStart": 133.98666666666668,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 140.21666666666667,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "8e96a5a52c1cef036f31a4d71c3040abe83b67f3a7bc554ff1a6e2417b884a58"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN11",
      "text": "Versus the belt-swinging, non-singing assassin!",
      "chapter": 5,
      "masterStart": 526.76,
      "masterEnd": 529.58,
      "chapterLocalStart": 146.32666666666665,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 149.14666666666668,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "1f447ed38d0aec445a559cb312f03ad314c7161c7c9c217f01d58bb992090acc"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN12",
      "text": "You see the leather pants\u2014P. Tang!",
      "chapter": 5,
      "masterStart": 532.84,
      "masterEnd": 535.39,
      "chapterLocalStart": 152.40666666666667,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 154.95666666666668,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "0753f76345c29c731750d78916ac80b4aba357b2700495aaf6413f123aaf9fde"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN13",
      "text": "Our next two fighters\u2014Chonk Lee! And the hands for hire, the Fadefather\u2014Bushedo Brown!",
      "chapter": 5,
      "masterStart": 594.57,
      "masterEnd": 601.28,
      "chapterLocalStart": 214.13666666666666,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 220.84666666666666,
      "tempo": 1.0,
      "processedSHA256": "b4baa8ef80989be4a379db4e0cf64e6e1cb04422a4a580d6e600f90125013fd9"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN14",
      "text": "And he comes out swinging! Absolute chaos in the ring!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 812.44,
      "masterEnd": 815.7792916666667,
      "chapterLocalStart": 4.073333333333333,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 7.412625,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "b979c85c03933deab356cf059349a7b802d4239b86f52b70685668026e9b3c09"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN15",
      "text": "Oh, come on! That's got to be a foul!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 815.7992916666667,
      "masterEnd": 817.96,
      "chapterLocalStart": 7.432625,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 9.593333333333334,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "8dc1747e0cf972371dc7906866008bb439b279f0ec45cd85b512fe7218162da8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN16",
      "text": "Two on one? They're teaming up, and nobody's calling it!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 817.98,
      "masterEnd": 820.9442916666667,
      "chapterLocalStart": 9.613333333333333,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 12.577625,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "d1aeddeeb548c17ba11f7d9178aad1c75f24b0169fffff0b74f8148c3c603e07"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN17",
      "text": "This is getting wild!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 820.9642916666667,
      "masterEnd": 822.2321458333333,
      "chapterLocalStart": 12.597625,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 13.865479166666667,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "10245d5ca2ad0a07fb308489643e93a5c87edce93d93f03915c4755cfa9b2c5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN18",
      "text": "Wait\u2014what is he doing?",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 822.2521458333333,
      "masterEnd": 823.5110833333333,
      "chapterLocalStart": 13.885479166666666,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 15.144416666666666,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "74bb5a111e28b9b336ca0977c119ee8f44da59340f668fc4de077f9034f2de53"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN19",
      "text": "Is that a belt trick?",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 823.5310833333333,
      "masterEnd": 824.620375,
      "chapterLocalStart": 15.164416666666666,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 16.253708333333332,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "8e552c040031a57fcb3cb103cca2a501d93027db3c673681807e5638ac088b47"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN20",
      "text": "I need a new pair of glasses\u2026 or a nap.",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 824.640375,
      "masterEnd": 827.0064375,
      "chapterLocalStart": 16.27370833333333,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 18.639770833333333,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "b21bf975bca00ba8bee708e742a887f9dd61b5dd52ac578cf38605eed681abe8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN21",
      "text": "Definitely a nap.",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 827.0264375,
      "masterEnd": 828.0264375,
      "chapterLocalStart": 18.659770833333333,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 19.659770833333333,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "052ffa3b2887ddb755b089a59b8a295ed492e7618253f83f9505535ce2dea2ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN22",
      "text": "And here we go! The Golden Glo Hero\u2014the white-shirt fighter\u2014is in the ring!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 828.3228541666666,
      "masterEnd": 832.805,
      "chapterLocalStart": 19.9561875,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 24.438333333333333,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "3e66ad1c04b1e18760aa1da82519439e728b48a32cfc08226103eee7a62fb4ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN23",
      "text": "Wait a minute\u2014is that his girlfriend?",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 832.825,
      "masterEnd": 834.5303541666667,
      "chapterLocalStart": 24.458333333333332,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 26.1636875,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "6ac79f3c8041f9eb2fb843f69e42fa6f1756aa8b2bc918fc5e35b8302ee2507c"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN24",
      "text": "She's got front-row seats!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 834.5503541666667,
      "masterEnd": 835.9521458333334,
      "chapterLocalStart": 26.1836875,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 27.585479166666666,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "4e537f77100f3703373afa51d1629d494da72bf8cb41347861c04d0080ec278b"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN25",
      "text": "Oh, come on! The headband fighter's already breaking the rules!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 835.9721458333333,
      "masterEnd": 839.2221458333333,
      "chapterLocalStart": 27.605479166666665,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 30.855479166666665,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "34ceeea30b1529b63c064f26acee053230e83e526e01b8c72e078253357d4e17"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN26",
      "text": "No\u2014he lost his belt!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 839.2421458333333,
      "masterEnd": 840.8403541666667,
      "chapterLocalStart": 30.87547916666667,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 32.4736875,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "0d2154c3ea17d4addaf4028b7b388a42dcb1e11c4dd2100372cec5b59cbae058"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN27",
      "text": "The belt trickster\u2014defeated by his own signature prop!",
      "chapter": 8,
      "masterStart": 840.8603541666666,
      "masterEnd": 843.8603541666666,
      "chapterLocalStart": 32.4936875,
      "chapterLocalEnd": 35.4936875,
      "tempo": 1.12,
      "processedSHA256": "2575e1ed97502e57ef7c422989b791d503ddb94f93b874cf1b5c69d94961e171"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANN28",
      "text": "That kick had more style than sense!",
